        {
          "id": "AC-1",
          "statement": "Proposal Compiler 接受 DAG node 的可选单值 recovers；recipe.work_item.spec.recovers 必须精确相等。缺失目标、自引用、depends_on 冲突、不同 capability、非可恢复终态或已有 replacement 均以稳定 reason 阻止 recipe_ready/compile。",
          "verified_by": [
            "harness-tests"
          ],
          "requirement_clauses": [],
          "knowledge_claims": []
        },
        {
          "id": "AC-2",
          "statement": "Recovery manifest 绑定 predecessor ID、Work Item SHA-256、runtime SHA-256/status/replacement、Evidence 与 Checkpoint 路径及摘要；任一输入漂移使 compiler check 返回 stale，create-only/idempotent 合同保持。",
